  "solution": {
    "text": "As,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0072_cc672363bd61.png\" style=\"width:2in;height:1.54653in\" /><br />The required area <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> sq. units"
